    "title": "Federal Goverment Shutdown Falls '100 Percent Within Congress's Power': Legal Analyst | NTD",
    "text": "The federal government remains shut down as the Senate is unable to reach a bipartisan deal to fund the government. The Trump Administration is planning to lay off some workers, and some groups are already suing over this. For discussion, NTD spoke to Bobbie Anne Cox, fellow of the Brownstone Institute and legal analyst. She’s also a civil rights attorney.\nFederal Goverment Shutdown Falls '100 Percent Within Congress's Power': Legal Analyst\nBobbie Anne Cox, legal analyst, discussed what a federal government shutdown means for Americans.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 10/1/2025, 11:23:27 PM EDT",
